1377
01:02:12,720 --> 01:02:16,720
And so the result was few patents were commercialized.

1378
01:02:16,720 --> 01:02:21,720
Only about 5% of patents were commercially licensed.

1379
01:02:21,720 --> 01:02:23,720
So Bayh-Dole came along and said,

1380
01:02:23,720 --> 01:02:25,720
