1386
01:02:39,720 --> 01:02:43,720
Oh, and by the way, they can license it exclusively.

1387
01:02:43,720 --> 01:02:45,720
So they did.

1388
01:02:45,720 --> 01:02:47,720
And this is what Bayh-Dole requires universities.

1389
01:02:47,720 --> 01:02:51,720
They have to retain ownership of innovations.

1390
01:02:51,720 --> 01:02:54,720
They have to file the patent inventions, patents.

1391
01:02:54,720 --> 01:02:59,720
They have to give licensing preferences to small businesses.

1392
01:02:59,720 --> 01:03:02,720
They do provide the government with a royalty-free license.

1393
01:03:02,720 --> 01:03:05,720
Rarely an issue, but they have

1394
